      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nottingham%2C_Maryland"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Nottingham Lots were the “ground zero” of a multi‑generational land dispute between the Lords Baltimore and William Penn over border rights.",
